# Color Auto Detailing - Local Development

## Environment Setup

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values:

```
# API Configuration
PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api

# Contact form email (Resend)
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=admin@colorautodetailing.com
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=no-reply@colorautodetailing.com

# Google Analytics 4 (Public - visible in browser)
PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Google Tag Manager (Public - visible in browser)
PUBLIC_GTM_ID=GTM-PMBBJ2B6

# Google Site Verification (Public - visible in browser)
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# reCAPTCHA v3 (https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin)
# Get keys from: https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin
PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=

# GA4 Reporting API (Server-side, for employee analytics dashboard)
# Create a service account in Google Cloud Console with GA4 read access
GA_PROPERTY_ID=
GA_CLIENT_EMAIL=
GA_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Database (if using a backend)
# DATABASE_URL=

# Authentication
# JWT_SECRET=
```

## Notes

- `PUBLIC_*` variables are exposed to the browser
- Other variables are server-side only
- Never commit `.env.local` with real credentials
